{"events": [{"method": "turn/started", "payload": {"status": "running", "threadId": "01a126f4b6517a22bdc67f5a96c15956", "turnId": "t1"}, "seq": 1, "threadId": "01a126f4b6517a22bdc67f5a96c15956", "timestamp": "1791654934319", "turnId": "t1"}, {"method": "item/user_message", "payload": {"content": "这是 GUI 工具卡渲染测试（知识与代码智能），请严格按顺序各调用一次，不要并行：\n1. skill 读一个可用的技能（任选一个，比如 dock-guide）\n2. memory_search 搜 \"工具卡\"\n3. memory_get 读一条 memory_search 返回的记忆（没有结果就读 MEMORY.md）\n4. lsp 对 src/main.rs 做 document symbols（按需工具，先 search_tool 找；没有语言服务器也照样调用一次）\n做完用一句话总结。", "threadId": "01a126f4b6517a22bdc67f5a96c15956", "turnId": "t1"}, "seq": 2, "threadId": "01a126f4b6517a22bdc67f5a96c15956", "timestamp": "1791654934319", "turnId": "t1"}, {"method": "item/reasoning_delta", "payload": {"delta": "用户", "threadId": "01a126f4b6517a22bdc67f5a96c15956", "turnId": "t1"}, "seq": 3, "threadId": "01a126f4b6517a22bdc67f5a96c15956", "timestamp": "1791654943183", "turnId": "t1"}, {"method": "item/reasoning_delta", "payload": {"delta": "要求按", "threadId": "01a126f4b6517a22bdc67f5a96c15956", "turnId": "t1"}, "seq": 4, "threadId": "01a126f4b6517a22bdc67f5a96c15956", "timestamp": "1791654943375", "turnId": "t1"}, {"method": "item/reasoning_delta", "payload": {"delta": "顺序各", "threadId": "01a126f4b6517a22bdc67f5a96c15956", "turnId": "t1"}, "seq": 5, "threadId": "01a126f4b6517a22bdc67f5a96c15956", "timestamp": "1791654943565", "turnId": "t1"}, {"method": "item/reasoning_delta", "payload": {"delta": "调用一次", "threadId": "01a126f4b6517a22bdc67f5a96c15956", "turnId": "t1"}, "seq": 6, "threadId": "01a126f4b6517a22bdc67f5a96c15956", "timestamp": "1791654943898", "turnId": "t1"}, {"method": "item/reasoning_delta", "payload": {"delta": "四个", "threadId": "01a126f4b6517a22bdc67f5a96c15956", "turnId": "t1"}, "seq": 7, "threadId": "01a126f4b6517a22bdc67f5a96c15956", "timestamp": "1791654943899", "turnId": "t1"}, {"method": "item/reasoning_delta", "payload": {"delta": "工具：", "threadId": "01a126f4b6517a22bdc67f5a96c15956", 